<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0;net8.0;netstandard2.0;netstandard2.1</TargetFrameworks>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Description>LiteOrm 远程服务调用</Description>
    <AssemblyVersion>8.1.5.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>8.1.5.0</FileVersion>
    <VersionPrefix>8.1.5</VersionPrefix>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
8.1.5:
- 注册方式重构为「配置回调 + 注入工厂」：新增 AddRemoteOptions() 工厂，选项可经 IServiceProvider（如 IConfiguration）构造，运行时工厂优先于 configure 回调。
- 移除 LiteOrmRemoteOptions.TransportFactory，自定义传输层统一通过 Transport 实例或 AddRemoteOptions() 工厂注册；IRemoteServiceTransport 改为延迟解析，未配置时在校验阶段抛出。
- 同步 LiteOrm.Common 8.1.5。

8.1.4:
- 同步 LiteOrm.Common 8.1.4（Regex Lambda 支持、复杂类型映射变更、SQL 函数方言补全、字符串常量内联）。
- RemoteViewServiceAsyncProxy 的 SearchAsAsync / SearchOneAsAsync 补充 CancellationToken 参数。
- 增加泛型方法支持。

8.1.3:
- LiteOrm.Common 更新至 8.1.3。

8.1.2:

8.1.1:
- 改进：
  - LiteOrm.Common 更新至 8.1.1；
  - ProxyGenerator 采用单例模式。
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/danjiewu/LiteOrm</PackageProjectUrl>
    <Copyright>Copyright @ 2026 danjiewu</Copyright>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/danjiewu/LiteOrm.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.Remote.nuget.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <LangVersion>14.0</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.Remote.nuget.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\LiteOrm.Common\LiteOrm.Common.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Castle.Core" Version="5.2.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Castle.Core.AsyncInterceptor" Version="2.1.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net10.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.Abstractions" Version="10.0.5" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.5" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.Abstractions" Version="8.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1' OR '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.Abstractions" Version="2.2.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="2.2.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
